# Common Patterns

## Deep Boundaries

- Put browser-safe finding, query, time-range, and Dataset Event contracts in
  `packages/shared`.
- Put server-only ingestion protobuf definitions and generated TypeScript in
  `packages/proto`.
- Put reusable shadcn / Tailwind primitives in `packages/ui`.
- Keep ClickHouse ingestion and gRPC producer details out of dashboard UI
  modules; the browser talks to the gateway over GraphQL and SSE only.

## Validated Contracts

Validate once at each boundary with `zod/mini` and pass typed values inward.
GraphQL and SSE success/error shapes, pagination cursors, Redis Stream ids,
dataset versions, and Dataset Events must be explicit and stable. Do not invent
a generic CRUD repository abstraction for immutable dataset versions.

## Immutable Publication

Treat each Dataset Version as an immutable identity namespace. Redis Stream
entries are append-only, and current Finding changes create newer ClickHouse
row versions; never rewrite an already-served event.
